tID+\" está \"+attempt.State+\", não rodando\")), lost))\n+\t\t}\n+\t\tif f.jsonOut {\n+\t\t\twriteDelegateJSON(stdout, map[string]any{\"schema\": delegateCancelSchema, \"attempt\": attempt.AttemptID, \"released\": true, \"run\": run.RunID, \"status\": run.Status})\n+\t\t\treturn 0\n+\t\t}\n+\t\tout := render(stdout, stderr)\n+\t\tout.Field(\"delegate.attempt\", attempt.AttemptID)\n+\t\tswitch {\n+\t\tcase run.RunID == \"\":\n+\t\t\tout.Field(\"delegate.released\", tr(\"true: no reservation was published; the stalled marker was removed\", \"true: nenhuma reserva foi publicada; o marcador parado foi removido\"))\n+\t\tcase run.Status == posemodel.ReviewRunFailed && strings.HasPrefix(run.Failure, posemodel.DelegationAbandonedCause):\n+\t\t\tout.Field(\"delegate.released\", tr(\"true: recorded as failed run \"+run.RunID+\" (abandoned before its run was recorded)\", \"true: registrada como run com falha \"+run.RunID+\" (abandonada antes de o run ser registrado)\"))\n+\t\tdefault:\n+\t\t\t// The attempt had a run already: its receipt was completed with\n+\t\t\t// it (review round 11, N3).\n+\t\t\tout.Field(\"delegate.released\", tr(\"true: completed with run \"+run.RunID+\", already recorded as \"+run.Status, \"true: concluída com o run \"+run.RunID+\", já registrado como \"+run.Status))\n+\t\t}\n+\t\treturn 0\n+\t}\n \tif !attempt.Active {\n \t\treturn delegateFail(stdout, stderr, f.jsonOut, \"cancel\", 1, withDelegationLosses(errors.New(tr(\"attempt \"+attempt.AttemptID+\" is \"+attempt.State+\", not running\",\n \t\t\t\"a tentativa \"+attempt.AttemptID+\" está \"+attempt.State+\", não rodando\")), lost))\ndiff --git a/pose-mcp/internal/cli/governance_stats.go b/pose-mcp/internal/cli/governance_stats.go\nindex 85edee59..d2830565 100644\n--- a/pose-mcp/internal/cli/governance_stats.go\n+++ b/pose-mcp/internal/cli/governance_stats.go\n@@ -129,7 +129,7 @@ func cmdGovernanceStats(root string, args []string, stdout, stderr io.Writer) in\n \tout.Field(\"coverage.reviews\", f